+      'Android.launcher-584   [001] d..3 12622.506950: sched_switch: prev_comm=Android.launcher prev_pid=584 prev_prio=120 prev_state=R+ ==> next_comm=Binder_1 next_pid=217 next_prio=120', // @suppress longLineCheck
